  speakerName: Wen
  characterAvatar: {fileID: 0}
  arrivalPrompt: You have arrived at the site.
  arrivalButtonText: Start
  dialogueLines:
  - "I\u2019ve always felt a special connection to this Cathedral, ever since I first
    visited it in 2011."
  - Back in 2011, while staying with my homestay Susan as an international student,
    we came here just a week before the earthquake. The Cathedral Square was vibrant,
    and I could hear musi ccoming from inside.
  - 'We only took a quick photo outside on the West Porch and didn''t step in. At
    the time, it just seemed like an ordinary visit, but I never imagined that would
    be my last chance. '
  - 15 years have passed, I revisit here today not only to meet Susan, but also to
    check the place. The place has gone through so many changes since the earthquake
    that I hardly remembered what it tused to look like.
  - Since I never got to step inside back then... could you help me discover what
    the Cathedral might have sounded like that day?
  alignmentPrompt: 'Open the camera, and you will see a green plane on the floor.
    Please take your time to  observe and listen. '
  alignmentButtonText: I'm in Position
  interactionInstruction: 
  interactionButtonText: Got it
  reflectionPrompt: Take a moment to reflect on what you've just experienced.
  reflectionButtonText: Continue
